*.local
.DS_Store

# csharp-engine/ (Blazor WASM + Roslyn C# execution engine, see docs/csharp-engine-poc.md)
# csharp-engine/driver/ (desktop-.NET twin used by test/helpers/nodeCSharpEngine.ts) has its own
# bin/obj one level down, covered by the same recursive-ish patterns below.
csharp-engine/bin/
csharp-engine/obj/
csharp-engine/driver/bin/
csharp-engine/driver/obj/
# Reference-assembly DLLs are copied from the installed .NET SDK's targeting pack at build time
# (CSharpEngineBlazor.csproj's CopyCSharpEngineRefAssemblies target) — never committed as binaries.
csharp-engine/wwwroot/refs/
